#
# PROOF-POLICY §2 requires every Agda theory proof to be rechecked in Rocq (and
# Lean). No Rocq witness exists yet: XP-1's rocq leg is recorded `open` in
# ../LEDGER.json, so no artifact is listed here for the compile gate to run.
#
# Adding the witness means all four steps, in one change:
#   1. write verification/proofs/coq/<Witness>.v
#   2. list it below as `gated`
#   3. fill in the rocq leg row in ../LEDGER.json: status, route
#      (transported|re-proved), statement_compared, axioms, evidence
#   4. re-derive the grade in ../LEDGER.json
# The ledger gate fails if the artifact exists but is unlisted (here or in the
